      {
        "id": "real-sample",
        "what": "No real subscriber or SIM export has been read against this layout. It is a generic draft: the header names, the date format and the status words are designed, not observed. Promotion needs a real sample read in the vault (counts and booleans only) and the owner's confirmation.",
